# pnpm deliberately keeps packages out of the repository-root node_modules, which is
# great for catching phantom dependencies but breaks tooling that resolves imports
# from the root rather than from each workspace (the editor's TypeScript server is
# the common case: it cannot see react, electron, or zod without this).
#
# Hoisting is therefore enabled so a root-level TypeScript project can resolve the
# same packages each workspace uses. `pnpm typecheck` still runs per workspace.
public-hoist-pattern[]=*
